PEQUA7,  TAD (400    / SET RESULT BIT      /A010
  TAD I  PEQUA1    / ADD DESTINATION ADDRESS    /A010
  DCA I  PEQUA1    / PUT BACK WITH RESULT BIT SET    /A010
PEQUA9,  ISZ  PEQUAT    / BUMP RETURN ADDRESS      /M012
  JMP I  PEQUAT    / RETURN


PADD,  XX
  TAD  PADD    / SET UP RETURN ADDRESS ON PAGE ZERO
  DCA  GOBACK

  JMS  MATH    / 2ND ON STACK = TOP OF STACK + 2ND ON STACK
  0      / OPERATION CODE
  / RETURNED TO CALLER BY A 'JMP I GOBACK' FROM 'FINISH' ROUTINE

PMINUS,  XX
  TAD I  TOP    / GET FIRST WORD OF VALUE TO BE NEGATED
  RAL      / PUT SIGN BIT IN LINK
  CML RAR      / COMPLIMENT SIGN BIT AND ROTATE BACK
  DCA I  TOP    / AND PUT BACK IN PLACE
  JMP I  PMINUS    / RETURN

/  THE FOLLOWING ROUTINE MOVED HERE TO MAKE SPACE ON EDIT 013

/  Update_Summary_And_Last_Character_Flags as per USALCT.
USALCF,  XX
