/INITIALIZATION CODE:
/CLEAR VARIABLES AND INTERMEDIATE REGISTER (C,
/COMPRESS DIGITS IN BOTH A AND B, TEST DIGITS,
/CONVERT DIGITS TO BCD, GET SIGNS, COUNT DIGITS
/TO LEFT AND TO RIGHT OF DECIMAL POINT,
/SAVE SIGN OF RESULT, DISPATCH TO PROPER ROUTINE.

MATH,  0
/  TAD  (A  / INITIALIZE PAGE 0 POINTERS TO  B
/  DCA  PA  / A NEVER GETS DESTROYED SO NO NEED TO INIT
  TAD  (B
  DCA  PB

/ IF (A OR B) ARE UNINITIALIZED            /A003
/   THEN SET RESULT TO UNINITIALIZED          /A003
/   ELSE IF (A OR B) ARE OVERFLOWED          /A003
/      THEN SET RESULT TO OVERLFLOWED        /A003

  TAD  TOP  /TOP = LOCATION OF TOP OF STACK (TOS)    /A003
  TAD  (VALSIZ              /A003
  DCA  T1  /T1 = LOCATION OF SECOND ON STACK (SOS)    /A003

  TAD I  T1  /GET FIRST WORD OF SOS
  MQL    /PUT IN MQ
  TAD I  TOP  /GET FIRST WORD OF TOS
  MQA    / AC = (AC OR MQ)   PERFORM INCLUSIVE OR
  RTL    / LINK = UNDIFINED BIT;  SIGN = OVERFLOW BIT
  SZL    / IS EITHER UNDEFINED?
  JMP  PERR4  /    YES, HANDLE ERROR
  SPA CLA    /    NO, IS EITHER OVERFLOWED?
  JMP  PERR2  /          YES, HANDLE ERROR

/ NEITHER VARIABLE IS UNDEFINED OR OVERFLOWED SO PERFORM MATH
  JMS  CLEAR  /CLEAR VARIABLES.
  SA    /  LOCATION OF 1ST VARIABLE.
  -6    /  -NUMBER TO CLEAR.
  JMS  CLEAR  /CLEAR INTERNAL RESULT ARRAY
  C    /  LOCATION OF ARRAY.
  -MAX-MAX  /  -LENGTH.

  TAD  T1
  JMS  SCAN  /SCAN AND COMPRESS TOP
  A;SA

  TAD  TOP  /POINT TO SOS          /M003
  JMS  SCAN  /SCAN AND COMPRESS SECOND ELEMENT
  B;SB

  TAD  SA  /ADD SIGNS TOGETHER IN ORDER TO XOR THEM
  TAD  SB
  TAD I  MATH  /ADD IN OPERATION TYPE.
  SMA    /IS OPERATION MUL/DIV?
  JMP  MA3  /NO, MUST BE ADD/SUB.
  DCA  SA  /YES, XOR OF SA AND SB IS SIGN OF RESULT.
  TAD I  MATH  /GET OPERATION TYPE.
      /DISPATCH ON OPERATION, MUL OR DIV.
  RAL
  SMA CLA
  JMP I  (MULOP
  JMP I  (DIVOP
MA3,  RAR    /XOR OF SA AND SB TO LINK TO SELECT
      /ACTUAL ADDITION OR SUBTRACTION
      /(LINK=1 FOR SUBTRACTION.
      /(NOTE: INITIAL SIGN OF RESULT
      /IS ALREADY IN SA.
  SZL CLA    /AC=ARGUMENT FOR "JMS  ADSB".
  TAD  (SBS-ADS  /SBS: SUBTRACTION.
  TAD  (ADS  /ADS: ADDITION.
  JMP I  (ADDSUB


  /SUBROUTINE TO CLEAR AN ARRAY

CLEAR,  0
  TAD I  CLEAR  /ADDRESS.
  ISZ  CLEAR
  DCA  TMP1
  TAD I  CLEAR  /-LENGTH.
  ISZ  CLEAR
  DCA  TMP2
CL1,  DCA I  TMP1
  ISZ  TMP1
  ISZ  TMP2
  JMP  CL1
  JMP I  CLEAR

  /SUBROUTINE TO SCAN AND  COMPRESS INPUT ARRAYS
/AC=SOURCE
/JMS  SCAN
/DESTINATION ADDRESS

SCAN,  XX
  DCA  TMP1  / SET UP POINTER TO PACKED BCD VALUE

  TAD  (-VALSIZ/ GET NUMBER OF WORDS IN VALUE
  DCA  TMP5  / SET UP COUNTER

  TAD I  SCAN  / GET ADDRESS OF OUTPUT
  ISZ  SCAN  / BUMP RETURN ADDRESS
  DCA  TMP2  / TMP2 = START OF ARRAY (OUTPUT)

  TAD I  SCAN
  ISZ  SCAN  / BUMP RETURN ADDRESS
  DCA  TMP3  / TMP3=ADDR OF (SIGN;LEFT;RIGHT)


/SET UP SIGN WORD (SA, OR SB)
  TAD I  TMP1  / GET FIRST WORD OF VALUE
  SPA CLA    / IS VALUE NEGATIVE?
  ISZ I  TMP3  /    YES, SO SET SIGN TO 1
  ISZ  TMP3  / POINT TO LA OR LB

  JMP  MIDDLE  / PROCESS MIDDLE BCD VALUE OF FIRST WORD

LEFT,  TAD I  TMP1  / GET PACKED BCD VALUE
  BSW; RTR  / PUT LEFT VALUE ON RIGHT SIDE
  JMS  LOAD  / LOAD THE DIGIT OR RADIX POINT

MIDDLE,  TAD I  TMP1  / GET PACKED BCD VALUE
  RTR; RTR  / PUT MIDDLE VALUE ON RIGHT SIDE
  JMS  LOAD  / LOAD THE DIGIT OR RADIX POINT

RIGHT,  TAD I  TMP1  / GET PACKED BCD VALUE
        / RIGHT BCD VALUE IS ON RIGHT SIDE
  JMS  LOAD  / LOAD THE DIGIT OR RADIX POINT

  ISZ  TMP1  / BUMP THE PACKED BCD POINTER
  ISZ  TMP5  / ARE WE DONE ALL OF THE WORDS IN THE VALUE?
  JMP  LEFT  /    NO, DO LEFT BCD OF NEXT WORD
  JMP I  SCAN  /    YES, RETURN


LOAD,  XX
  AND  (0017    / MASK OUT ALL BUT THIS BCD VALUE
  DCA  TMP6    / STORE IN A TEMP
  TAD  TMP6    / RETRIEVE AGAIN
  TAD  (-BCDRAD  / COMPARE WITH RADIX POINT
  SNA CLA      / IS IT RADIX?
  JMP  SC1    /    YES, GO TO HANDLE
  ISZ I  TMP3    /    NO, COUNT LA,LB,RA,RB.
  TAD   TMP6    / ACCEPT AND  COMPRESS THE CHAR.
  DCA I  TMP2    / PUT INTO OUTPUT
  ISZ  TMP2    / BUMP OUTPUT POINTER
  JMP I  LOAD    / RETURN


/HANDLE DECIMAL POINT
SC1,  ISZ  TMP3  / POINT TO RA OR RB.
  JMP I  LOAD  / RETURN


