/ADDITION/SUBTRACTION OPERATION

/NOTE: C THROUGH C+MAX-1 WILL CONTAIN THE INTEGER PORTION,
/C+MAX THROUGH C+MAX+MAX-1 WILL CONTAIN THE DECIMAL PORTION.

ADDSUB,  DCA  AD11  /INITIALIZE ADD OR SUB OPERATION.
  TAD  PA  /TRANSFER A TO C.
  DCA  TMP1
  TAD  LA  /SHIFT TO PROPER PLACE IN C.
  CIA
  TAD  (C+MAX)
  DCA  TMP2
  TAD  LA  /TMP3=LENGTH OF A.
  TAD  RA
  CMA
  DCA  TMP3
AD1,  ISZ  TMP3  /END OF A YET?
  SKP
  JMP  AD2  /YES: ADD B TO C.
  TAD I  TMP1  /NO: TRANSFER THE CHAR.
  ISZ  TMP1
  DCA I  TMP2
  ISZ  TMP2
  JMP  AD1


